 1082:     until it cost a datum: SOLVD's 1991 primary report carries no 'Randomized
 1083:     Controlled Trial' tag -- the tag is applied inconsistently to pre-1995
 1084:     records -- while a 1998 secondary analysis does, so the type test promoted
 1085:     the secondary above the primary. An attribute that is MISSING for the old
